 also  gives the scabbards the moment they  deserved  they were not useless they did not wait  and plan for nothing  odin was right they cannot be  underestimated and by the same token we  should not  overestimate the untouchability of kaido  either kaido has been mentally scarred  by odin even more so than physically  he feels the wound owed and inflicted on  him it hurts his eyes are wide  and bloodshot you can see fear in his  sweating face  he is shocked that our boys can stab him  and he screams  the yonko feared as the strongest  creature screams  let that sink in kaido comments that  they have odin's haki  and they are thus able to harm him they  come crashing to the ground below  and people are shocked this has set the  perfect possible tempo for this war  how you start out often sets the tone of  the battle kaido is clearly showing us  the importance of the mental side of the  battle as well  as the physical side it's hard to get  motivated or develop morale  when everyone thinks that it's hopeless  or that they'll lose without  accomplishing anything  if kaido had just brushed off their  swords and killed all the red scabbards  right there  this would be a very different fight but  that's not what happened  everyone saw the great yonko bleed sweat  scream  they saw fear in him and now our side is  pumped up  while kaido's crew is probably shocked  and confused  seeing a weakness if only momentarily in  their yonko  through this act alone the red scabbards  have already accomplished something  significant that shouldn't be overlooked  just as people are speculating that  there may be more intruders  hyogoro makes his presence known even at  retirement age this dude is willing to  pick up a sword  for what's right for what he believes in  and for his own principles  props to him and there are many props  worthy moments in this chapter so let's  keep going  big mom in what can only be taken in a  lighthearted way  seems to observe that this party is  really dangerous and questions if kaido  died  i assume this is her speech bubble she  has shown respect to kaido's strength  before  so she knows how hard he'll be to kill  but still  you get a sense that big mom is very  unfazed and practically smiling about  what's happening  definitely the opposite of kaido's  freaked out face that we saw recently as  yamato is rushing with luffy to attack  kaido while he's weak  ulti gets in the way as far as cat  fights go the ones between  these two are pretty brutal ulti is  still upset because yamato knocked her  out in one hit  although it clearly didn't leave lasting  damage luffy also recognized ulti as  quote unquote the headbutt and the  headbutt girl is becoming quite a fan  favorite her blatant straightforward  manner very much reflects luffy's own  and she's a cute but tough dino girl so  what's not to like  yamato then says the day has come to  become kozuki odin and ulti says what  we're all thinking  i don't get it and she also adds are you  an idiot idiot or not  i'm definitely wondering why yamato  doesn't just say stuff like i'm inspired  by lord odin  or i want to carry out odin's will or i  want to be like odin no  she straight up says she is odin does  this possibly have something to do with  odin saying his soul  will live on to kaido let me know what  you guys make of this  is ulti right is yamato just being an  idiot or is there something more to it  the fact that kaido treated yamato so  badly in the past  like almost blowing her up and hitting  her seems to be related with kaido  suffering ptsd from odin and yamato  insisting to be that very enemy he's so  fierce  while beast pirates are trying to warn  yamato that kaido has been attacked  she straight up lets them know that she  is no longer an ally of the beast  pirates  and that she doesn't care if her father  dies after all he was ready to kill her  with the explosive as ulti and yamato  clash  this time on seemingly more equal  footing big mom screams out luffy's name  we got luffy face to face with iyanko  but luffy just tells her he's busy right  now yonko or not  one does not simply interrupt luffy when  he is busy this is reminiscent to me of  when he ran into mihawk at marineford  and thought that he was too busy trying  to save ace at the time  to take on such a strong opponent it's  not really about luffy being scared he's  just got other priorities at this moment  and such a strong opponent being in his  way is definitely inconvenient  in the meantime nami and carrick decide  to run away from the homies and  they do so without any problems in the  process they prove that they can fend  for themselves for the most part and  they won't slow luffy down  obviously throw in a yonko or a  commander and it won't go that easily  but in this case it works out  big mom tells luffy that she's come from  far away  just to kill him making it known where  her main priority lies  this is luffy's influence right here he  can influence one of the strongest  pirates in the world to drop  everything and chase him the strongest  beings become obsessed with him  that speaks volumes about luffy's  current influence in the world of one  piece no matter how his physical  strength currently matches up with  kaidos and big moms  back to kaido who was hurt but is  clearly not down for the count  he realized that orochi's so-called  delusions were true the red scabbards  were in the shadows of the straw hats  who kaido acknowledges us as enemy  that's pretty lit  as well you ain't getting a yonko to  acknowledge every pirate  as an enemy you gotta be special for  that kaido never expected the scabbards  to team up with pirates and he tells  them that pirates will betray them  as soon as they start losing they'll run  clearly this seems to be the way kaido  views the world he betrayed orochi by  saying this  he also implies that he's willing to  betray big mom too  and he knows that she might betray him  it's expected of pirates  however we know that luffy is not like  that not all pirates are the same  luffy is one who lives honorably and by  his principles he's a man of his word  and by this point kinemon has learned  that too not only does kinemon say that  luffy is different from kaido  he even says that luffy will stand on  the top of the sea  aka be the pirate king even if the  scabbards die  luffy will make sure don comes to wano  luffy like the scabbards  aside from kunjuro obviously proved that  you can live in an honorable way  not everyone is just concerned with  preserving their own life or being on  the winning side  then we jump to the other yonko and  luffy and i can barely believe i'm  saying those words  because it means that we're  significantly into this multi yonko  level war  big mom asks luffy why he came to wano  and tells him not to say something  ridiculous like he came here to defeat  kaido and luffy agrees to everyone's  shock  people are like yo luffy don't tell me  you changed your mind you're a rock  if you showed out wtf are we gonna do  but  luffy in another iconic moment for the  ages doubles down even triples down on  his confidence  he's not here to defeat kaido to just  defeat kaido that is he's also here to  defeat big mom  the commanders orochi and all of his  subordinates he's not  making any compromises or taking any  prisoners he's come to mop the floor  with all of them  and i can't but help have a big stupid  grin on my face when i read this  talk about falling off the horse and  getting back up luffy got bodied by  kaido  and he comes back confident that he can  beat kaido another yonko  all the commanders and more what an  absolute boss  he proclaims this is an all-out war and  that's what we've been waiting for  another war  a bigger and more significant one than  even marine ford  now to be fair it may be too early to  make a statement like that but i truly  believe it will be big mom laughs at the  idea of a few hundred people  accomplishing anything