erence to alice in  wonderland and i  absolutely love it we are about to see  something epic ladies and gentlemen we  are witnessing history  in the making and i hope you all feel as  blessed as me for getting to experience  it and that is it for today's review we  had kaido bleed  showing the strength of the scabbards  but also the weakness of kaido  like when goku let down his guard and  got penetrated by a laser gun  kaido is weaker when he's in his  mentally unstable ptsd state  that is another way in which odin  continues to help the others  in this fight even from beyond the grave  kaido is clearly better now and he's  sober  too so we still haven't seen nothing yet  especially not the strongest power in  the world  that kaido hinted at we're also going to  see opie soolong transformations  including of characters like nekomamushi  and inuarashi who could fight the  all-star commander  jack without even entering into it this  is gonna be hella crazy as  luffy said when he mentioned kicking  everyone's butt this is all a war baby  and it's exciting af  as always let me know your thoughts on  these latest developments  and where you see us going from here if  you did enjoy this one piece review and  want to keep them coming  smash that like button to let me know  turn it blue like jimbei  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial ring that notification  bell or you will miss future one-piece  reviews and as you impatiently wait for  the next chapters to drop  feel free to check out my growing one  piece playlist where i got videos about  the yonko warlord supernova zone logia  and paramecia fruits  and even a video about how strong kaido  is you can find all those videos  and more by clicking the link in the  description a very special thank you  goes to our patrons over on patreon who  helped make videos like this one  possible first and foremost i want to  thank the patron of legend the one  acknowledged by lord tuigo himself  alpha and are the 